msgid ""
"The basic MicroPython firmware is implemented in the main port file, e.g. "
"``main.c``:"
msgstr ""
"De basis-MicroPython-firmware wordt geïmplementeerd in het hoofdportbestand,"
" bv. ``main.c``\\ :"

